  "body": "Much more than your traditional character home, this substantial St Heliers residence offers a fully self-contained one-bedroom apartment with independent access, an enormous garage/man cave and flexible accommodation for the whole family.\r\n\r\nRich in charm and character, the distinctive multi-gabled weatherboard home showcases beautiful leadlight windows, native timber floors, decorative cornices and original joinery, complemented by thoughtful modern improvements.\r\n\r\nGenerous living spaces and versatile accommodation provide plenty of room for family life, while a lower-level bedroom with kitchenette adds another dimension for teenagers, guests or extended family.\r\n\r\nA real highlight is the fully self-contained one-bedroom apartment, complete with its own kitchen, bathroom, living area, balcony and independent entrance. This valuable addition further enhances the versatility of the home, providing an ideal solution for extended family, guests or potential supplementary income.\r\n\r\nThen there's the huge garage/man cave - an exceptional space for car enthusiasts, hobbies, a workshop or simply those wanting room for all the toys. A standout feature in its own right and a rare find in this desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a 494m² site with a substantial floor area of approximately 313m², this impressive property is located in sought-after St Heliers, enjoying easy access to the village, beaches, local amenities and excellent schools.\r\nWhether you're accommodating multiple generations, seeking additional income potential or looking for a character home with extraordinary flexibility and garaging, this is a property that deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
